                                          rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/>;
                                          rdfs:label "Online Account".
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/accountName> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/>;
                                        rdfs:label "account name".
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/homepage> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
